    "tertiary_canon_star_M3": "Visible star (mag 2.5-3.5) — important fragments and shorter primary works.",
    "cluster_member_M4": "Cluster star (mag 3.5-4.5) — texts that operate in constellation with anchor works rather than as independent objects."
  },
